# Store (Zustand 5)

`src/store.ts` — central state. `persist` writes `AppSettings`, `tasks`, `agentConversations` to localStorage key `sakrylle-store`. Images/thumbnails in IndexedDB (`db.ts`).

## State slices

- `settings` — profiles, activeProfileId, apiMode, appMode
- `tasks` — generation task records
- `agentConversations` — Agent history
- `input` — prompt, inputImages, maskDraft
- `ui` — toasts, modals, agent draft, selected task

## Core actions

`submitTask`, `submitAgentMessage`, `retryTask`, `regenerateAgentAssistantMessage`, `exportData`/`importData`, `clearData`, `initStore`

## Image cache (non-Zustand)

- Memory LRU: `imageCache` (8 originals), `thumbnailCache` (80 thumbs)
- Backfill via `requestIdleCallback`; `subscribeImageThumbnail(id, cb)` for components

## Import chain

store → db.ts / agentApi.ts / api.ts / openaiCompatibleImageApi.ts / groupSelection.ts / oauthFallback.ts / agentSentinels.ts

## Agent notes

- History in IndexedDB, not localStorage
- Branch refs scoped to current path only
- `ApiProfile.imageProfileId` delegates image generation to another Images profile
- Stream markdown via `streamdown` — `tailwind.config.js` must include `node_modules/streamdown/dist/*.js`
